{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840530/extras/cb5f41950b517d16beaea224d46c5a43.poster.avif?t=1755285104\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840530/extras/cb5f41950b517d16beaea224d46c5a43.webm?t=1755285104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840530/extras/cb5f41950b517d16beaea224d46c5a43.mp4?t=1755285104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ISPELL</strong> is a hardcore <strong>top-down bullet hell</strong> awaits you with a focus on shooting accuracy, reaction and a sense of the rhythm of battles. Dodge projectiles, fight your way through waves of enemies and survive in the craziest conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840530/extras/efd10c39f0948bb7ba3ed63050020628.poster.avif?t=1755285104\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840530/extras/efd10c39f0948bb7ba3ed63050020628.webm?t=1755285104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840530/extras/efd10c39f0948bb7ba3ed63050020628.mp4?t=1755285104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 unique types of weapons </strong>-\u00a0choose your style and fight your way through the\u00a0storm of bullets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A variety of different enemies</strong>\u00a0- from fast-moving drones and destructive machines to terrifying werewolves and snipers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A boss at the end of every level</strong>\u00a0- all with unique behavior, fighting style and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 chapters</strong> with it's own visual atmosphere and unique sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level reveals a fragment of the <strong>history of the world</strong>\u00a0- the past that speaks through the present.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840530/extras/37f3b55219ed89a50410e58b7759d4a4.poster.avif?t=1755285104\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840530/extras/37f3b55219ed89a50410e58b7759d4a4.webm?t=1755285104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840530/extras/37f3b55219ed89a50410e58b7759d4a4.mp4?t=1755285104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 intense levels</strong> of crazy adventure filled with battles and a bright, sometimes gloomy atmosphere.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handmade pixel art</strong>\u00a0- from light-filled landscapes to charred ruins, accompanied by a colorful and sometimes dramatic <strong>electronic soundtrack</strong> - all this immerses in a world living out it's last hours.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840530/extras/529a3e88ff0c39240c317fea167237ff.poster.avif?t=1755285104\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\